{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"海關機場檢31公斤魚翅　拘控51歲內地女子\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CUST-FISH-261108-23.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】海關在機場檢獲約31公斤懷疑屬受管制乾魚翅，一名內地女子被捕。</p><p>海關估計檢獲的乾魚翅市值約13萬元。事發在周六，一名51歲內地女子從巴西經埃塞俄比亞抵港，於機場入境大堂被海關截查，發現其寄艙行李有懷疑受管制的列明瀕危物種乾魚翅，交由漁護署落案控告她非法進口瀕危物種罪。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.758857+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T15:08:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:09.266698+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:55.079114+00:00","content_hash":"00f13f8b80be88ef32de6ef5898381beb51e1b780eed434d4c470babb9e8d9a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.758857+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}